<title>BELGIUM: Belgian net debt totalled 9,803 bln bfr in March.</title>
<headline>Belgian net debt totalled 9,803 bln bfr in March.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury released</p>
<p>the following data on the state's debt - (in bln francs)</p>
<p>    STATE DEBT	  end-March   change in mth   change in 1997</p>
<p>Long-term debt</p>
<p>    - Belgian francs     6,985.1   +34.6		-13.7</p>
<p>    - foreign currencies   681.9    +9.8		+23.3</p>
<p>Short-term debt</p>
<p>    - Belgian francs     1,984.0    +59.3	    +193.7</p>
<p>    - foreign currencies    77.7    -12.2	     + 2.3</p>
<p>    net debt		 9,802.5   +95.6	     +274.0</p>
<p>    net borrowing requirement	+96.9	     +243.0</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
